# A Testing Time (2-2), a repeat with 2-2 already cleared. Janshura-Rashura plays 78 (option 4 begins it), then, with
# the mission still current at status 2, the section-2 event 133 (its finish with option 4 does nothing). Moreno-Toeno
# plays 687 (option 1 does nothing, option 2 starts the window), 204 twice (48 hours left), then 208, 209, 206 and 202
# end the runs.
lists PortWindurst/Janshura-Rashura/onTrigger PortWindurst/onEventFinish/78 WindurstWaters/Moreno-Toeno/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/181 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/182 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/198 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/199 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/200 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/201 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/202 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/206 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/208 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/209 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/687
